// The easydev-platform workspace. During platform development the three core
// servers are checked out as SIBLINGS and wired here, so a change in any of
// them is picked up immediately without publishing a version. For a standalone
// build (Dockerfile, CI) these `use` lines are ABSENT and the modules come from
// the proxy — see go.mod.
//
// Layout expected by this file:
//   ../easyvcs   ../easyblobs   ../easyops   ../easydev-platform

go 1.27.2

use (
	.
	../easyvcs
	../easyops
)
